<h1>Pending bills tracker</h1>
<div class="post-body">
<p class="section-intro">This section tracks bills and reforms on mediation and ADR, for 197 countries and supranational bodies out of a total of 195 jurisdictions tracked by <a href="https://mediareinformati.it" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mediareinformati.it</a> (plus 2 supranational bodies, the European Union and the UN). Each entry marked with the <span class="bill-status bill-status-pending" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;">IN PROGRESS</span> badge is periodically rechecked: when a reform is passed, the badge changes to <span class="bill-status bill-status-approved" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;">APPROVED</span> as has already happened for Bulgaria, Croatia, China and others. Last checked: 17/08/2026. Sources: direct research on official parliamentary and government websites, in the original language.</p>
